  <Docs>
    <summary>Marks source code as generated and identifies the code generator.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>Apply this attribute to generated source code to distinguish it from user-written code. Use <see cref="P:Javax.Annotation.Processing.GeneratedAttribute.Value" /> to identify the generator and, optionally, record when the source was generated and include generator-specific comments.</para>
    </remarks>
  </Docs>
